@startuml activity_admin_rbac
 title Increment 1 — Administrator Provisioning and Account Management
 skinparam shadowing false
|System|
start
:Secure operator starts one-time setup command;
:Acquire database lock and verify no administrator exists;
if (Secret valid and no admin exists?) then (yes)
  :Create first Administrator transactionally;
  :Consume one-time setup authorization;
else (no)
  :Stop and record security event;
  stop
endif
|Administrator|
:Log in and open user management;
|System|
:Validate active session and Administrator role;
if (Authorized?) then (yes)
  :List and display user accounts;
  |Administrator|
  :View account and submit permitted edits or role assignment;
  |System|
  :Validate fields and role enum;
  :Persist update and write audit event;
  :Return confirmation;
  stop
else (no)
  :Return safe access-denied response and audit event;
  stop
endif
@enduml
